/**
 * Soft-delete an attachment record by ID for compliance, privacy, and lifecycle management. Legal hold enforcement applies.
 *
 * This endpoint marks the shopping_mall_ai_attachments record as deleted (soft delete) if:
 * - The attachment exists
 * - The attachment is not already deleted
 * - The attachment is not under legal hold ("legal_hold" flag is false)
 *
 * If the attachment does not exist, is already deleted, or is under legal hold, an error is thrown.
 *
 * @param props - Request properties
 * @param props.attachmentId - Unique identifier of the attachment (UUID)
 * @returns void (no response body)
 * @throws {Error} When the attachment does not exist, is already deleted, or is under legal hold
 */
